        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"1034135\">@Ash Manda</span> Thank you!! <img alt=\":dataverse_man:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://avatars.zulip.com/53090/emoji/images/c7b94a03.png\" title=\"dataverse man\"></p>",
